    "content": "**Who this is for:** anyone running a cluster they got working by copying an\nexample, who now needs to change it. &#x2A;*What you'll have at the end of this\nsection:** the ability to read any Forge config and write one from an\nempty file. &#x2A;*Time:** an afternoon, most of it on the capstone."
