  "contents": [{
    "heading": undefined,
    "content": "**Who this is for:** you have run scaling workers and\nscaling the CAS by hand, you trust the numbers, and you\nwant the pool to size itself. &#x2A;*What you'll have at the end:** a worker\ndeployment that grows and shrinks on queue depth, with probes, drain, and\ndisruption budgets wired up. &#x2A;*Time:** a day to assemble, a week of watching\nbefore you trust it."
