    "content": "**Who this is for:** whoever gets paged when the build farm is slow. &#x2A;*What\nyou'll have at the end of this section:** a production-shaped deployment, a\nmetrics pipeline that tells you when it's unhealthy, and a written answer for\neach of the ways it fails. &#x2A;*Time:** ongoing."
