    "content": "Everything up to the How-to guides is about making Forge do what you want.\nThis section is about making it keep doing that while you aren't looking.\nThe questions change shape: not \"how do I configure a filesystem store\" but\n\"what happens when that filesystem fills up overnight, how will I know, and what\ndo I do about it.\""
