    "heading": "before-you-open-the-pr",
    "content": "**Check that it compiles and typechecks.** `bun --filter @forge/docs build`\ncatches an MDX parse error or a stray import that the dev server tolerated."
  }, {
    "heading": "before-you-open-the-pr",
    "content": "**Run pre-commit** over what you changed,\n`pre-commit run --files <paths>`, for Vale."
