        children: "FAILED_PRECONDITION"
      }), ", its\noutcome ", _jsx(_components.code, {
        children: "KILLED_DISK"
      }), ". The walk runs on the blocking pool as its own task,\nso memory sampling carries on meanwhile. With either disk mode the action's\nusage report carries ", _jsx(_components.code, {
        children: "peak_disk_kb"
      }), ", what it wrote, from one walk of the\naction directory at completion, which is the only walk ", _jsx(_components.code, {
        children: "guard"
