  W[["Worker process<br/>runs the actions"]]
  SCH -->|reads/writes blobs over gRPC| CAS
  W -->|worker_api :50061| SCH
  W -->|blobs over gRPC :50051| CAS
  CAS --> D[("filesystem or object store")]`
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "Three facts about that picture are the whole design:"
