    "heading": "cache_metrics",
    "content": "Cache metrics store wraps another store and emits low-cardinality\nOpenTelemetry cache operation metrics for the wrapped store."
  }, {
    "heading": "cache_metrics",
    "content": "This wrapper is opt-in. Stores that are not explicitly wrapped by\n`cache_metrics` are constructed exactly as they are without this\nwrapper and do not pay its hot-path timing or recording cost."
