    "content": "—"
  }, {
    "heading": "redisspec",
    "content": "The hostname or IP address of the Redis server. Ex: `[\"redis://username:password@redis-server-url:6380/99\"]` 99 Represents database ID, 6380 represents the port."
  }, {
