  }, {
    "heading": "redisspec",
    "content": "—"
  }, {
    "heading": "redisspec",
    "content": "10"
  }, {
    "heading": "redisspec",
    "content": "DEPRECATED: use `command_timeout_ms` The response timeout for the Redis connection in seconds."
