    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "`classes`"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "array of SizeClassSpec"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "—"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "—"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "The fleet's size ladder. A hint may name a `class` instead of numbers, and the cold-start policy below picks one for actions no hint matches. Empty means raw numbers only."
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "`default_class`"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "string"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "—"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "—"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "The class an untagged action gets when no hint and no rule below matches. Takes precedence over `cold_start` when both are set."
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "`class_by_mnemonic`"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "map of string to string"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "—"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "—"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "Class by Bazel `action_mnemonic` for untagged actions; a known heavy mnemonic (`TestRunner`, `Link`) starts in the right class."
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
    "content": "`class_by_timeout`"
  }, {
    "heading": "historicalresourcespec",
