  }, {
    "heading": "experimentalontaps3spec",
    "content": "If the number of seconds since the `last_modified` time of the object is greater than this value, the object will not be considered \"existing\". This allows for external tools to delete objects that have not been uploaded in a long time. If a client receives a `NotFound` the client should re-upload the object."
  }, {
