    "heading": "healthconfig",
    "content": "Path of the readiness check, the stricter sibling of `path`: it answers 503 while any component is still initializing, where `path` answers 200. A worker's registration with its scheduler is such a component, so a Kubernetes readiness probe on this path turns Ready only once the worker can take work. Must differ from `path`; the same path for both is refused at startup."
  }, {
