    "heading": "diskenforcement",
    "content": "Fetch inputs regardless of free space."
  }, {
    "heading": "diskenforcement",
    "content": "`\"guard\"`"
  }, {
    "heading": "diskenforcement",
    "content": "Refuse the action when the free space under the work directory is below its reservation."
  }, {
    "heading": "diskenforcement",
    "content": "`\"soft\"`"
  }, {
    "heading": "diskenforcement",
    "content": "`guard`, and kill an action whose files under its own directory grow past its reservation plus `disk_headroom_percent`. Sampled every ten seconds by walking the action directory, counting only files the action itself wrote (inputs are hard links into the CAS and are not counted)."
  }, {
