    "heading": "how-an-instrument-becomes-a-prometheus-series",
    "content": "The Prometheus exporter in\n`otel-collector-config.yaml`\nis configured with `namespace: forge`, which prefixes every series with\n`forge_`."
  }, {
    "heading": "how-an-instrument-becomes-a-prometheus-series",
    "content": "The exporter rewrites the OTLP name into Prometheus form: dots become\nunderscores, and monotonic counters gain a `_total` suffix. Histograms fan out\ninto `_bucket`, `_sum` and `_count` series."
  }, {
    "heading": "how-an-instrument-becomes-a-prometheus-series",
    "content": "`cache.operations` (a counter) is therefore scraped as `forge_cache_operations_total`,\nand `cache.operation.duration` (a histogram) as `forge_cache_operation_duration_bucket`\nand friends. Change the collector's `namespace` and every name on this page changes\nwith it."
  }, {
    "heading": "how-an-instrument-becomes-a-prometheus-series",
    "content": "Where a name in the **Prometheus series** column is unmarked, it is not a\nprediction: it is the name that actually appears in the shipped rules,\ndashboards and alerts under `deployment-examples/metrics/` and `kubernetes/&#x60;.\nA name marked &#x2A;(unreferenced)* is derived from the two rules above, because no\nshipped artifact mentions that metric at all: nothing has ever queried it, so\nnothing has confirmed the exporter's spelling of it."
  }, {
    "heading": "declared-but-never-emitted",
    "content": "Every instrument declared in `metrics.rs` has at least one call site."
  }, {
    "heading": "cache-metrics",
    "content": "Global cache metrics instruments."
  }, {
    "heading": "cache-metrics",
    "content": "Declared as `CACHE_METRICS` in `forge-util/src/metrics.rs:438`, backed by the `CacheMetrics` struct."
  }, {
    "heading": "cache-metrics",
    "content": "Every cache instrument is emitted from one place: the `cache_metrics` store wrapper. A store that is not wrapped emits nothing, no matter how the collector is configured."
  }, {
