    "heading": "what-a-store-is",
    "content": "The store's *type* is whichever key you put inside its object:\n`filesystem`, `memory`, `compression`, `fast_slow`, and so on. Forge\npicks the implementation from that key; everything else in the object is\nthat implementation's config. The set of legal keys is the variant list of a\nsingle enum, so the reference below and the parser cannot disagree."
  }, {
    "heading": "two-families",
