  "contents": [{
    "heading": undefined,
    "content": "**Who this is for:** you want the whole system (cache *and* remote execution)\nrunning on one machine, either to try it or to give a small team something\nshared. &#x2A;*What you'll have at the end:** three containers serving a real CAS,\nscheduler and worker, a build pointed at them, and a clear picture of what\nseparates this from production. &#x2A;*Time:** 20 minutes, most of it spent\ncompiling."
