  }, {
    "heading": "when-it-fails-locally-but-not-in-ci",
    "content": "Namespace/worker tests fail on Ubuntu 24.04"
  }, {
    "heading": "when-it-fails-locally-but-not-in-ci",
    "content": "`kernel.apparmor_restrict_unprivileged_userns` is on by default"
  }, {
    "heading": "when-it-fails-locally-but-not-in-ci",
    "content": "Disable it for the session, or skip those tests locally and let CI run them"
  }, {
    "heading": "when-it-fails-locally-but-not-in-ci",
    "content": "`Too many open files`"
  }, {
    "heading": "when-it-fails-locally-but-not-in-ci",
