  }, {
    "heading": "faq",
    "content": "Not in the binary. Every code path in the open-source distribution runs in\nthe open-source distribution; that is the point of the section above about\nenforcement. What you buy is the entitlement to two of those paths in\nsettings the Business Source License restricts, plus the managed service\nand support that sit outside the repository entirely."
  }, {
