    "heading": "faq",
    "content": "`priority` if you have one OS in the fleet, `exact` the moment you have two.\nThe example configs use `priority` with an empty value because a homogeneous\nfleet gains nothing from enforcing it, but that's a default for a tutorial,\nnot a recommendation for a mixed fleet. With `exact` you get a real routing\nguarantee; with `priority` you get a label."
