  }, {
    "heading": "directories-that-are-not-crates",
    "content": "Kustomize overlays (`dev`, `kubernetes-example`, `lre-manual`, `chromium-example`) that assemble the pieces under `kubernetes/`"
  }, {
    "heading": "directories-that-are-not-crates",
    "content": "`deployment-examples/`"
  }, {
    "heading": "directories-that-are-not-crates",
    "content": "Reference deployments you copy and adapt: `docker-compose`, `metrics`, `persistent-workers`, `rhel`"
  }, {
    "heading": "directories-that-are-not-crates",
    "content": "`kubernetes/`"
  }, {
    "heading": "directories-that-are-not-crates",
