    "heading": "redis_store",
    "content": "**Type:** RedisSpec"
  }, {
    "heading": "noop",
    "content": "Noop store is a store that sends streams into the void and all data\nretrieval will return 404 (`NotFound`). This can be useful for cases\nwhere you may need to partition your data and part of your data needs\nto be discarded."
