  }, {
    "heading": "filesystemspec",
    "content": "—"
  }, {
    "heading": "filesystemspec",
    "content": "Path on the system where to store the actual content. This is where the bulk of the data will be placed. On service startup this folder will be scanned and all files will be added to the cache. In the event one of the files doesn't match the criteria, the file will be deleted."
  }, {
    "heading": "filesystemspec",
    "content": "`temp_path`"
