  }, {
    "heading": "retry",
    "content": "A list of error codes to retry on, if this is not set then the default error codes to retry on are used. These default codes are the most likely to be non-permanent: `Unknown`; `Cancelled`; `DeadlineExceeded`; `ResourceExhausted`; `Aborted`; `Internal`; `Unavailable`; `DataLoss`"
  }, {
