  }, {
    "heading": "experimentalontaps3spec",
    "content": "5MB"
  }, {
    "heading": "experimentalontaps3spec",
    "content": "The maximum buffer size to retain in case of a retryable error during upload. Setting this to zero will disable upload buffering; this means that in the event of a failure during upload, the entire upload will be aborted and the client will likely receive an error."
  }, {
