  }, {
    "heading": "propertytype",
    "content": "When the scheduler matches tasks to workers that are capable of running\nthe task, this value will be used to determine how the property is treated."
  }, {
    "heading": "propertytype",
    "content": "One of:"
  }, {
    "heading": "propertytype",
    "content": "string"
  }, {
    "heading": "propertytype",
    "content": "`\"minimum\"` — Requires the platform property to be a u64 and when the scheduler looks for appropriate worker nodes that are capable of executing the task, the task will not run on a node that has less than this value."
  }, {
    "heading": "propertytype",
    "content": "`\"exact\"` — Requires the platform property to be a string and when the scheduler looks for appropriate worker nodes that are capable of executing the task, the task will not run on a node that does not have this property set to the value with exact string match."
  }, {
    "heading": "propertytype",
    "content": "`\"priority\"` — Does not restrict on this value and instead will be passed to the worker as an informational piece. In the future this will be used by the scheduler and worker to cause the scheduler to prefer certain workers over others, but not restrict them based on these values."
  }, {
    "heading": "workerallocationstrategy",
    "content": "When a worker is being searched for to run a job, this will be used\non how to choose which worker should run the job when multiple\nworkers are able to run the task."
  }, {
    "heading": "workerallocationstrategy",
    "content": "Value"
  }, {
    "heading": "workerallocationstrategy",
    "content": "Description"
  }, {
    "heading": "workerallocationstrategy",
    "content": "`\"least_recently_used\"`"
  }, {
    "heading": "workerallocationstrategy",
    "content": "Prefer workers that have been least recently used to run a job."
  }, {
    "heading": "workerallocationstrategy",
    "content": "`\"most_recently_used\"`"
  }, {
    "heading": "workerallocationstrategy",
    "content": "Prefer workers that have been most recently used to run a job."
  }, {
    "heading": "experimentalsimpleschedulerbackend",
