  }, {
    "heading": "deployment-topologies",
    "content": "The `docker-compose/` one is the most useful of them, because it is the\ntopology the project's own integration tests run against: a CAS process on\n`50051`, a scheduler with the execution and AC services on `50052`, a worker,\nand the scheduler's worker API on `50061` left unpublished so it is only\nreachable inside the compose network."
  }, {
    "heading": "deployment-topologies",
    "content": "Local testing covers running this and\npointing a build at it; Production configuration\ncovers what changes when it stops being a demo."
