    "heading": undefined,
    "content": "BuildStream can use a Remote Execution API backend for artifact storage,\nAction Cache, CAS, and remote execution. Forge can serve those\nendpoints from the same `localhost:50051` listener used by the other local\nexamples."
  }, {
    "heading": undefined,
    "content": "The repo includes a runnable BuildStream integration test at\n.\nIt starts Forge with a local worker, runs `bst build hello.bst`, and\nchecks for `SUCCESS Build`."
  }, {
    "heading": "start-forge",
    "content": "Use a config that exposes CAS, Action Cache, execution, capabilities,\nByteStream, fetch, and push services on `localhost:50051`."
