    "heading": "services",
    "content": "The health endpoint (`/status` by default) and the admin endpoint (`/admin`\nby default; both paths are configurable) are plain HTTP handlers on the same\nlistener. They will not appear in gRPC reflection, and a health check does\nnot need a gRPC client."
