    "heading": "partially-implemented-rpcs",
    "content": "Both appear in Forge's vendored CAS proto and are sometimes mistaken\nfor Forge inventions. They are part of the upstream REAPI definition\n(content-defined chunking), vendored along with everything else. Forge\nserves them only for CAS instances that configure `experimental_chunking`\n(or proxy to a `grpc` store that does); elsewhere the capabilities response\nreports them unsupported and the RPCs return `Unimplemented`."
