    "heading": "what-to-do-in-order",
    "content": "mTLS is the only client identity Forge can express"
  }, {
    "heading": "what-to-do-in-order",
    "content": "Give workers their own network segment with egress rules"
  }, {
    "heading": "what-to-do-in-order",
