  }, {
    "heading": "what-to-do-in-order",
    "content": "Decide you can rebuild a worker host at any time"
  }, {
    "heading": "what-to-do-in-order",
    "content": "Assume one will need it"
  }, {
    "heading": "what-to-do-in-order",
    "content": "From a developer workstation, `nc -vz <scheduler-host> 50061` fails to\nconnect. If it succeeds, stop and fix the network before anything else."
  }, {
